            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Representatives of this class are for example: combine-harvester. Calculations are based on a 10000 kg harvesters, with a useful life of 1300 hours and a repair factor of 0.55. For exact results, module should only be used if lifetime and repair factor of the balanced machinery are within a narrow range of the values the module is based on. The functional unit is 1kg harvester during its lifetime.;
